      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yangpu%2C_Shanghai"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1927, Yangpu hosted 57 foreign textile factories, making it a global textile hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yangpu%2C_Shanghai"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Yangpu’s early factories were among the first to use blockchain for material tracking, a system born here to authenticate vintage textile machinery exports.",
